      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8952fc3a54370a77",
      "translationZh": "技能增益衡量改进幅度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db18122a1eb8897f",
      "translationZh": "如果你将一个现有技能传给 upskill eval，它就会为该技能生成测试用例，并使用这些用例评估模型。测试用例是简单的输入/输出对，用于验证智能体是否理解任务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c07fa1e5c869ff22",
      "translationZh": "我们还可以测试一个技能在不同模型上的表现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f322736b13014ef3",
      "translationZh": "这有助于你找到成本与性能之间的最佳平衡点：也许配备该技能的 Haiku 就足以满足你的使用场景，从而节省可观的 API 费用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22cf4040e2249bde",
      "translationZh": "下一步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae978be40a84d570",
      "translationZh": "我们已经展示了 upskill 能够创建经过验证的技能，将强大模型的领域专业知识迁移到更便宜的模型中。kernel-builder 技能只是其中一个例子，展示了这种方式的潜力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5eed33bcf2f39a9",
      "translationZh": "可以尝试以下几件事：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22ee1d0b01873b5c",
      "translationZh": "为你的内部工具生成技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc1edaddb244464c",
      "translationZh": "为你的代码库构建技能库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70574c4c70a5e644",
      "translationZh": "沉淀团队隐性知识",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb9484cb3a3b7d03",
      "translationZh": "跨模型进行基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87b6e24b6971abd4",
      "translationZh": "这种方法适用于任何原本需要反复编写详细提示词的专门任务。技能可在 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 以及其他支持 Agent Skills 规范的工具之间迁移。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
